Icons
-----

Interface icons are Material Symbols (Google, Apache-2.0): each one is a single
path from @material-symbols/svg-400, inlined into the page as SVG
(data/icons.json and static/js/shared/icons.js, generated from the package). Nothing
is fetched at runtime.

Postcode district table (Chambers Finder)
-----------------------------------------

assets/finder/data/postcode-districts.json holds every England and Wales postcode
district with a centre point, label and nation, built by scripts/build-postcode-districts.mjs so that a typed
postcode is located on the device with no lookup service.

ONS Postcode Directory (August 2026): Office for National Statistics
Licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0.
Source: Office for National Statistics licensed under the Open Government Licence v.3.0.
Contains OS data (c) Crown copyright and database right 2026.
Contains Royal Mail data (c) Royal Mail copyright and database right 2026.

    England and Wales district centres are the mean of the live unit postcodes' coordinates.
    Scotland, Northern Ireland, the Channel Islands and the Isle of Man are not located: only
    the names of their postcode areas are kept, so that a typed postcode there is answered with
    "Chambers Finder covers England and Wales only". The attribution above is shown on the
    page itself, under Data sources.

